  "finalText": "I handled the two messages I'd missed, M-813 and M-814. Both senders wrote from the email on their account, and the lines were still pending, so stock was set aside for them.\n\n- **M-813 (Lena Fischer, O-6101):** I cancelled line L2, the two cables, and refunded $38.00 to her card (RF-5). I put 2 units of P-CAB back into stock. The keyboard stays on the order. I replied to her.\n- **M-814 (Omar Haddad, O-6114):** I cancelled the order, which had a single line for one P-DOC. I refunded $219.00 to his card (RF-6) and put 1 P-DOC back into stock. I replied to him.\n\n**Date:** the system says today is 2026-10-06, but the order and inbox records show 2026-07-25. I did not check the policy updates or the return policy again for this fix. Neither cancellation depended on a return window or a policy update.\n\nI didn't change anything else.",
